 gging every industrial application as a core specialty.\nAdditional topic
 s: Reinforcement Learning\, System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics\
 , BCI & Neurotechnology\, Cognitive Science & Computational Cognition\nSc
 ope sources (2026): https://www.ieeesmc2026.org/call-for-papers\nScope la
